{"title":"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 19","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/e/44e657615d8f3a0f75eb89552a96eaf6c0649add.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1901+1902+1903+\\cdots + 1993) - (101+102+103+\\cdots + 193) =$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"544\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/a/2ea623a1aec84444f916d9d6d1a38e084a33fa63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 167,400 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 172,050 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 181,071 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 199,300 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 362,142$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"597\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/f/79faa3a158ed6db4470240593672421966a736ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1901=1800+101$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"145\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/a/02aadc3a2ba564e1f408d21419a7f81728d7b318.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1902=1800+102$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"145\" height=\"14\" />, etc. Each term in the first set of numbers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/a/2fa858c71f0659dbdb750259e38da3ead33c96b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1800$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> more than the corresponding term in the second set; Because there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/2/a72f553051fe3bcf42965f99d1a10ac6efed037e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$93$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> terms in the first set, the expression can be paired up as follows and simplified:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/5/9859b07f48b50dca996860593e380896aadc0c3f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(1901-101) + (1902-102) + (1903-103) + \\cdots + (1993-193)\\\\ =1800 + 1800 + \\cdots + 1800\\\\ =(1800)(93)\\\\ =\\boxed{\\text{(A)}\\ 167,400}\\]\" width=\"877\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME\" title=\"1993 AJHSME\">1993 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1993\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1993 AJHSME Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\